=== schema: agent_link ===
## type: agent_link

**Agent Link**

Let third-party agents built with the Agent Mesh link SDK join the mesh over one WebSocket each instead of the broker

> ⚠ Agents connect to /gw/<id>/v1/connect, each with its own token. Add link agents and choose this entrypoint for them; they are not part of these settings.

| Field | Type | Required | Default | Validation | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `maxFrameBytes` | `number` |  | `8388608` | range 1024–67108864 | Largest WebSocket message in either direction. A larger message from an agent closes its connection. Defaults to 8 MiB. |
| `maxInflight` | `number` |  | `16` | range 1–1024 | Tasks delivered to one connection that it has not acknowledged yet. Defaults to 16. |
| `maxConnectionsPerAgent` | `number` |  | `8` | range 1–256 | Connections one agent may hold open at once. Another one is closed. Defaults to 8. |
| `maxConnectsPerMinute` | `number` |  | `60` | range 1–6000 | Connections one agent may open per minute. More are refused with HTTP 429. Defaults to 60. |
| `taskTtlSeconds` | `number` |  | `7200` | range 1–604800 | How long a delivered task may stay unanswered before it times out. Defaults to 7200. |

